1
00:00:00,176 --> 00:00:02,176
[CLEARS THROAT LOUDLY]

2
00:00:02,846 --> 00:00:04,636
Why didn't you just have soup at home?

3
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:07,520
(Sheldon:)Penny, I have an IQ of 187.

4
00:00:07,684 --> 00:00:10,064
(Sheldon:)Don't you imagine
that if there were a way for me...

5
00:00:10,228 --> 00:00:13,188
(Sheldon:)...to have had soup at home,
I would have thought of it?

6
00:00:13,732 --> 00:00:15,112
(Penny:)You can have soup delivered.

7
00:00:19,529 --> 00:00:20,859
(Sheldon:)I did not think of that.

8
00:00:23,033 --> 00:00:25,363
(Sheldon:)Clearly, febrile delirium is setting in.

9
00:00:25,535 --> 00:00:30,035
(Sheldon:)Please bring me some soup
while I still understand what a spoon is for.

10
00:00:30,206 --> 00:00:31,956
Okay. What kind of soup do you want?

11
00:00:32,125 --> 00:00:34,665
(Sheldon:)Well, my mother used to make me
this split-pea...

12
00:00:34,836 --> 00:00:38,966
(Sheldon:)...with little frankfurter slices
and these homemade croutons.

13
00:00:39,132 --> 00:00:41,632
(Penny:)We have chicken, tortilla and potato leek.

14
00:00:42,552 --> 00:00:46,642
(Sheldon:)Can I get any of those with little
frankfurter slices and homemade croutons?

15
00:00:47,182 --> 00:00:48,602
(Sheldon:)No.

16
00:00:48,850 --> 00:00:50,680
(Sheldon:)Then surprise me.

17
00:00:52,979 --> 00:01:00,019
[BLOWS NOSE]

